Doug,
parboot() or nonparboot() is the best solution, or see Marc Mazerolles functions in AICcmodavg.

I had done some work to get SEs for the ZIP model by the delta approximation but making that work in general proved a pain in the ass, and the SEs are wrong when there's over-dispersion anyhow.  But if you gotta have them, see AICcmodavg for now.

regards
andy

