In sqrt(diag(vcov(model))) : NaNs produced
ms2.topmodels4<-subset(ms2,delta<=4)
ms2.topmodels4
ms2.avg<-model.avg(ms2.topmodels4)
ms2.avg
summary(ms2.avg)

Best regards,

Evan Hill

