Hi Shane,

Sorry, I cant help with your particular question relating to the dredge function, but my solution to running a long list of models might work for you too.  Instead of using dredge, I created a list of all the models I wanted to run.  I found some code online that takes the list of variables you have and returns all possible combinations of those variables.  You could do the same, then remove any models that contain any particular combination of variables.  The last step is to loop through the model list, running each one.  If you're interested I can send you the code.

Cheers,
Chris Merkord

